Itinerary Description:
Quoc An Pearl
08:30 am: Pick up at the hotel by tour guide;

09:00 am: Visit a Pearl farm: pearl is a famous special product of Phu Quoc island; here, tourist can observe the pearl growing and harvesting process;

Hon Thom Island
10:30 am: Get on the newly opened cable-car ride from Phu Quoc Island to Hon Thom, (Pineapple Island). Hon Thom cable car connects An Thoi Town to Hon Thom. On the cable car during high noon we can view the stunning coral reef topography being exposed below by the sunlight and calm transparent seas.

Phu Quoc Prison History Museum
14:30pm : Visit Phu Quoc Prison: once utilized during the Vietnam War to imprison political prisoners of North Vietnam, the prison is now a famous historical site of Phu Quoc island;

Ho Quoc Temple
